# ============================================================

# STRING SLICING - POSITIVE SLICING PRACTICE

# ============================================================

#

# Syntax:

# string[start:stop:step]

#

# Rules:

# 1. start is included

# 2. stop is excluded

# 3. positive step moves from left to right

# 4. If step is not given, default step is 1

#

# Try to predict the output before running each question.

# ============================================================





